 "remarks": "Step into a storybook for the summer. This picture-postcard Connecticut Colonial perfectly captures the timeless elegance of classic architecture while effortlessly delivering the modern conveniences your busy lifestyle demands. It's more than a house; it's a warm, cozy, and comfortable family home where memories are waiting to be made. Inside, you'll find a beautiful blend of original character and contemporary updates. Every room invites you to sit down, relax, and stay awhile, offering a seamless flow that works beautifully for both lively family gatherings and quiet days relaxing by pool. Situated in one of Darien's premier around the corner from our new park, Great Island, as well as Pear Tree Point Beach. Available July - September.",
